# niemo.io project research notes

This directory contains one voice-agent knowledge document for each of the 20 active projects published by the niemo.io frontend on August 13, 2026.

Each note distinguishes between:

- canonical facts declared in `src/data/myData.ts`;
- interface behavior directly observed at the published project URL on August 13, 2026; and
- first-person corrections and implementation details supplied by Eric Niemeyer; and
- technical interpretation, which is phrased as inference when it is not explicitly documented.

Two metadata differences are preserved rather than silently reconciled: the live Function Approximation page currently emphasizes gradient optimizers such as AdamW even though the portfolio calls it genetic polynomial fitting, and the live Attention page identifies Vue and TypeScript even though the portfolio records React and Tailwind.
